# Build context is the monorepo root for all three Dockerfiles. Keep it to what
# the images need: source, manifests, lockfile. Nothing here is read by
# `next build` or by the api/brain runtime.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.git
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets and local-only config. Runtime env comes from ECS / compose, never
# from a file baked into the image.
.env*
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
**/.terraform

# Not part of any image: infrastructure (Terraform state and providers can be
# gigabytes locally), docs, CI, editor and agent config.
infra
docs
.github
.claude
**/*.md
!apps/brain/fixtures/**
